A multi-line raw block is placed at its opening and verbatim after it

````
[^a]: note

  ```=html
  <b>x</b>
  <i>y</i>
  ```

see[^a]
.
<p>see<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>note</p>
      <b>x</b>
<i>y</i>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
````

````
> ```=html
> <pre>
> a
>   b
> </pre>
> ```
.
<blockquote>
  <pre>
a
  b
</pre>
</blockquote>
````
